00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:06.730
In the most literal sense,

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:10.150
sanctions are this.

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:11.120
A piece of paper.

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:13.450
A bunch of lists that governments make.

00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:14.530
That is what sanctions are.

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:15.850
Bureaucratic lists,

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:18.460
but this is a weapon of war.
It looks a little bit different

00:02:18.460 --> 00:02:19.380
than the kinds of weapons

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.000
we're used to seeing in war,

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.110
but this is a weapon.

00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:24.050
I am looking at a list

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:26.860
of hundreds and hundreds of names.

00:02:26.860 --> 00:02:28.790
People's names and their addresses

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:30.470
as well as their aliases,

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:33.470
their birthdays, their tax ID numbers,

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:35.353
and anyone else that is also on the list

00:02:35.353 --> 00:02:37.040
that they might be linked to.

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:37.873
Here in the US,

00:02:37.873 --> 00:02:39.570
this list comes from an office

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:42.050
that is focused on thinking about

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:44.040
things that come in
and out of our country.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:46.410
Sanctions are also this.

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:48.100
This comes from the white house,

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:49.620
and instead of people's names,

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:53.670
it has industries and
products like crude oil,

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:56.630
and liquified natural gas and coal,

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:58.250
and alcoholic beverages,

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:00.750
and diamonds and luxury goods.

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:02.050
And that is the point here.

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:04.680
What sanctions are, is
a giant list of people,

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:06.520
and things that are not allowed

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:08.660
to come into our country

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:10.550
or whatever country is
writing the sanction.

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:12.560
Oh, and the list includes,

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:16.280
the sale of US bank notes like cash.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:18.270
Like you're not allowed to
send like a pallet of cash

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:19.420
to the Russian government,

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:21.078
according to Joe Biden.

00:03:21.078 --> 00:03:21.911
Okay.

00:03:21.911 --> 00:03:23.130
But here's where it gets interesting.

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:25.080
I want to tell you how all these boring

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:26.430
lists of paper

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:28.770
that were drafted up in the past few weeks

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:31.470
actually translate into economic war.

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:33.020
What is happening right now

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:34.160
in the global economy.

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:35.220
It's totally invisible.

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:36.770
It's not like tanks and guns.

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:39.510
You can't see it, but
it's having a huge effect.

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:41.480
And I wanna show you what that looks like.

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:42.510
(suspenseful instrumental music)

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:44.210
The best way to do this
is to look at Russia

00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:46.360
before all of these sanctions.

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:48.490
You can see that Russia is connected

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:50.820
to the world in a lot of different ways.

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:52.210
I've color coded them for you.

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.340
Blue is everything that Russia exports

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:56.800
to other countries like oil, gold, coal.

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:58.470
Orange is everything
flowing the other way.

00:03:58.470 --> 00:04:00.494
Stuff that Russia imports like iPhones

00:04:00.494 --> 00:04:02.730
from the US or cars from Germany.

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:03.563
That's orange.

00:04:03.563 --> 00:04:05.310
Green is all of the money

00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:07.150
that needs to flow in and out of Russia

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:08.410
to keep things running.

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:10.090
That's money that businesses borrow

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:11.470
from foreign banks

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:13.410
or it's money that the Russian government

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:16.500
has put into US dollars or Euros

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:18.710
so that they have reserves
in case they need it.

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:20.800
We'll call this the financial stuff.

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:22.190
But then there's personal wealth,

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:23.350
which we'll put in purple.

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:24.183
One of the best parts

00:04:24.183 --> 00:04:25.200
about being a Russian billionaire

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.340
is that you can spend
millions and millions

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:31.000
of dollars on a flat in London or Paris.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:33.430
Or you can buy a yacht that you station

00:04:33.430 --> 00:04:35.410
in the port in the South of France.

00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:38.271
Russian billionaires have money and assets

00:04:38.271 --> 00:04:40.010
all around the world

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:42.120
that they use as their global playground.

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:42.953
And then of course,

00:04:42.953 --> 00:04:44.210
there's just regular Russians.

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:45.910
People who fly around the world

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:48.870
for tourism and business on airlines

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:50.840
that are from many different countries.

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:52.830
Those airlines fly over Russia

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:54.010
in Russian airspace

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:56.100
to get to a variety of destinations.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:56.933
So yeah.

00:04:56.933 --> 00:04:58.290
Russia is connected

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:01.000
like we all are to the global economy.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:04.740
We trade, we move around
and everyone thrives.

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:05.573
It's great.

00:05:05.573 --> 00:05:08.660
But then Russia invades
Ukraine a few weeks ago.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:09.650
- We are coming on the air

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:12.884
because the war in Ukraine has begun.

00:05:12.884 --> 00:05:14.684
(ominous instrumental music)

00:05:14.684 --> 00:05:17.057
(ground explosion)

00:05:17.057 --> 00:05:18.470
- "This is totally unacceptable."

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:19.640
Says the whole world.

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:21.570
We want to retaliate and show Putin

00:05:21.570 --> 00:05:22.470
that we can't do that.

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:23.930
We have to set a precedent that you're not

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:25.170
allowed to invade your neighbor,

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.390
but we can't send troops

00:05:26.390 --> 00:05:27.930
like we used to in the old days

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:30.020
because now we all have these big weapons

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:31.710
that could destroy our species.

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:32.980
So we can't like start fighting

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:34.370
with each other directly.

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:35.517
So what do we do?

00:05:35.517 --> 00:05:36.350
"I know."

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:37.957
Says all the angry Western leaders.

00:05:37.957 --> 00:05:40.670
"Let's start to mess with all of this.

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:41.780
That'll teach 'em."

00:05:41.780 --> 00:05:43.530
Welcome to economic war,

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:46.640
which again like I said, starts like this.

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:48.560
A bunch of bureaucrats making lists

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:50.250
of people and things and vessels

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.890
