00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:59.452
And let me show you how that might look.

00:05:59.452 --> 00:06:00.910
(suspenseful instrumental music)

00:06:00.910 --> 00:06:02.100
Okay, so this is Russia

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:04.530
happily connected to the global economy.

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:05.910
These sanctions target

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:07.900
every one of these connections.

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:09.660
Like let's just look at imports.

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:11.320
One of the first things the EU did

00:06:11.320 --> 00:06:12.980
was ban their countries

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:15.900
