00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:17.160
So the EU like, "Yeah.

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:18.770
Like we're pro Ukraine.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.390
Like we're drafting up these sanctions

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:22.210
to hurt Russian billionaires."

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:23.570
And then out of nowhere,

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:25.121
Italy crops up and is like,

00:06:25.121 --> 00:06:26.760
"Yeah, can we get an exemption?

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:28.100
Like, can we sell our goods?

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:30.566
Because we have like Gucci and Armani,

00:06:30.566 --> 00:06:32.270
and come on."

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:33.870
And they actually got an exemption.

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:35.150
And then people were like, "Wait, no.

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:36.720
We're not giving you an exemption.

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:38.880
Just because you have all
these fancy designers.

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:40.900
Like come on Italy, get with it."

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:42.880
And Italy was like, "Ugh, fine."

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:44.440
But it wasn't just the EU who started

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:45.410
cutting off these connections.

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:46.880
Singapore banned their people

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.920
from selling electronics and computers,

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:51.110
and Taiwan where all
the microchips are made,

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:52.040
banned their companies

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:53.700
from selling those microchips to Russia,

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:54.790
which is a giant deal

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:57.268
because microchips are in everything.

00:06:57.268 --> 00:06:58.470
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:06:58.470 --> 00:06:59.760
Hundreds of international companies

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:00.593
that were in Russia

00:07:00.593 --> 00:07:01.780
started to read the tea leaves,

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:03.510
and they're like, "We're out of here."

00:07:03.510 --> 00:07:05.700
Like imagine if McDonald's and Ikea,

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:07.590
and Apple all left your city,

00:07:07.590 --> 00:07:08.930
and then Netflix announced

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:10.340
that it no longer is streaming

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:12.370
in your country all in the same week.

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:13.840
Like this is real punishment.

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:16.093
This is what economic war looks like.

00:07:16.093 --> 00:07:18.090
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:07:18.090 --> 00:07:19.170
Okay, so that's imports.

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:21.070
The same thing starts
happening the other way.

00:07:21.070 --> 00:07:24.650
Russia is a giant exporter of oil and gas,

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:26.350
and all sorts of fossil fuels.

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:28.320
And so the west trying to inflict

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:29.680
punishment on Russia.

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:31.940
Bans their countries from importing

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:34.150
Russian oil and gas.

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:36.320
That is a huge blow to Russia.

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:38.800
Like the second biggest exporter

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:42.140
of refined and unrefined
petroleum on earth.

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:44.240
The economic war is heating up,

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:45.840
and in the middle of all of this,

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:48.070
Vladimir Putin gets up and announces

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:50.370
that he sees this as an act of war,

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:52.280
and that he is putting his nuclear weapons

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:54.681
on high alert as a response.

00:07:54.681 --> 00:07:58.598
(speaking in foreign language)

00:07:59.590 --> 00:08:00.423
- Like this is

00:08:00.423 --> 00:08:02.270
real war tactics we're talking about here

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:03.900
with real consequences.

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:04.733
All right.

00:08:04.733 --> 00:08:05.840
Let's get to the fun sanctions

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:07.947
like watching rich people squirm.

00:08:07.947 --> 00:08:09.338
(wine splurging)

00:08:09.338 --> 00:08:10.340
- Oh.

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:12.250
- Back to this list
that the government made

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:14.281
