00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:10.910
I see.

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:13.700
Make the most powerful
Russians uncomfortable,

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:15.640
and hopefully the will turn against Putin,

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:17.540
and get him to stop the war.

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:18.680
That's the logic.

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:20.250
And then you have this 26-year old

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:21.330
Instagram star

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:22.830
who's also on the sanctions list.

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:23.663
Wait what?

00:09:23.663 --> 00:09:24.496
Yes.

00:09:24.496 --> 00:09:25.470
Polina.

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:27.240
The daughter of the very rich

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:28.690
Foreign Minister of Russia

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:31.720
who lives a very fancy life in London.

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:33.510
And the UK sees this
and they're like, "No.

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:34.880
You've got blood on your hands too.

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:36.030
Put her on the list."

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:36.940
And she's on the list.

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:38.450
And now she can't travel to London

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:39.550
where she has a bunch of money,

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:41.770
and she has a big fancy flat,

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:43.270
and she's stuck in Russia.

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:44.310
She's on the list.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:45.840
This is happening to hundreds

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:48.010
of rich Russian people.

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:49.200
And like we don't know

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:51.280
if all of them are
connected to Vladimir Putin.

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:52.113
We're just like,

00:09:52.113 --> 00:09:53.320
"You're super rich and influential.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:54.920
So we're gonna make your life hard."

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:56.210
Please change this.

00:09:56.210 --> 00:09:57.360
Speaking of travel,

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.380
tons of countries have written sanctions

00:09:59.380 --> 00:10:00.810
that ban Russian airlines

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:02.400
from entering their airspace,

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:03.470
and tons of airlines

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:05.280
have cut their routes to Russia.

00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:07.160
So now the flow of people,

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:08.720
just human beings, tourists,

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:09.800
and business travelers

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:11.860
has come to a screeching halt.

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:12.693
Okay.

00:10:12.693 --> 00:10:14.460
Finally, the last category is big money.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.651
This is actually like
the hardest one to see,

00:10:16.651 --> 00:10:17.830
and understand,

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:20.070
but maybe the biggest and most important.

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:20.903
You have to understand

00:10:20.903 --> 00:10:21.860
that the Russian government

00:10:21.860 --> 00:10:24.880
holds on to tons of
reserves in other currencies

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:28.090
like Dollars and Euros and British Pounds.

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:30.120
They do this because if their currency,

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:31.690
the Rubles, falls,

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:33.560
they can take their
Dollars and buy a bunch

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:35.040
of Rubles and raise the price back up,

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:36.010
and stabilize it.

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:38.360
But now all of their foreign reserves,

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:40.550
their Euros and Dollars are frozen

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:43.727
in like American and like British banks.

00:10:43.727 --> 00:10:46.370
♪ You wanna build a snowman ♪

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.100
The Russian government
can't get their hands

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:49.620
on their money in other countries.

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.700
Okay, but the finance thing gets crazier.

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:53.790
Russian banks were then kicked out

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:56.660
of the system where banks can send

00:10:56.660 --> 00:10:58.150
giant amounts of money to each other.

00:10:58.150 --> 00:10:58.983
It's called SWIFT.

00:10:58.983 --> 00:10:59.816
They were kicked out.

00:10:59.816 --> 00:11:01.630
Now, they have to route
all their big payments

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:02.640
through like China,

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.540
which is like their one
friend in all of this.

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:06.420
And one more on the finance piece,

00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:08.190
regular Russians can't use

00:11:08.190 --> 00:11:09.430
their credit cards anymore

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:11.970
or their debit cards
because Visa, MasterCard,

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:14.100
American Express all pulled out of Russia.

00:11:14.100 --> 00:11:15.230
Like that would suck.

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:17.150
So all of this is to say,

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:19.670
that Russia went from looking like this

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:21.780
to looking like this.

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:23.520
Totally isolated.

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:25.070
And that was the goal.

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:27.990
To isolate Russia from the global economy,

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:30.330
and make them feel pressure on all levels.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:32.490
The people, the oligarchs,

00:11:32.490 --> 00:11:34.690
the government, the military,

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:36.150
the hope here is that the rich

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:37.060
Russian billionaires

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:38.810
who have a lot of influence in politics

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:41.020
as well as the people
who are now suffering

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:43.870
because they can't get
in on the global economy,

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:46.300
they will all look to
Putin and be like, "Dude.

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:47.860
Enough, we're done."

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:50.250
So the question is, will it work?

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:52.630
Well, it depends on what your definition

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:54.400
of work is.

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:56.490
In terms of creating economic pain.

00:11:56.490 --> 00:11:58.260
Yes, it's already working.

00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:00.020
I mean look at how hard the Ruble crashed

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:01.040
after the war started.

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:01.873
Because remember,

00:12:01.873 --> 00:12:03.310
the government can't get
its hands on all of its

00:12:03.310 --> 00:12:04.650
foreign reserves to help stabilize

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:05.483
their currency.

00:12:05.483 --> 00:12:07.960
The Moscow Stock Exchange
closed down for weeks.

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:09.720
The economy is shrinking.

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:11.610
There is scarcity in Russia.

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:12.500
But for me,

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:14.360
the definition of will this work,

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:17.350
is will this change Vladimir Putin's mind

00:12:17.350 --> 00:12:19.987
to get him to stop
fighting this stupid war?

00:12:19.987 --> 00:12:22.160
And that's a question I do not know

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:22.993
the answer to

00:12:22.993 --> 00:12:25.810
because sanctions are
not like normal weapons.

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:27.520
We've had guns and missiles and bombs

00:12:27.520 --> 00:12:28.353
for a long time.

00:12:28.353 --> 00:12:29.400
We know how they work.

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:30.840
We know how they deter people.

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:32.610
We know who they hurt

00:12:32.610 --> 00:12:35.100
but sanctions are not that old,

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:37.020
they're as old as our fairly new

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:38.810
Global Economic Order.

00:12:38.810 --> 00:12:42.200
We make these lists and put on these bans

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:45.730
for travel and industries
and financial systems.

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:46.900
And we just sort of hope

00:12:46.900 --> 00:12:48.220
that the ripple effect

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:50.400
makes it to Vladimir Putin's brain.

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:51.390
But I'm just not sure

00:12:51.390 --> 00:12:53.700
Putin is a rational actor anymore.

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:56.830
And that is the
contradiction of sanctions.

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:58.510
Is usually we put sanctions

00:12:58.510 --> 00:13:00.880
on countries like North Korea.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:03.030
These pariah states where the leader

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:04.930
is not a rational actor anymore.

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:07.730
They're bent on some
weird ideological vision.

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:09.790
They're surrounded by a bunch of yes men.

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:12.470
And so sanctions turn into just another

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:14.527
narrative that they can use to say,

00:13:14.527 --> 00:13:16.300
"We are the victims.

00:13:16.300 --> 00:13:17.420
We are embattled."

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:19.890
The rest of the world is at war with us.

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:23.130
Plus frankly, Russia still has a way out

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:24.340
of some of these sanctions.

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:27.470
China is still their ally in this,

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:28.790
and China is deeply connected

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:29.930
to the world economy.

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:31.320
Oh and also, do we really think

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:32.880
that Russian billionaires
are gonna be stopped

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:35.370
by a list from a bunch of bureaucrats?

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:37.040
These people are well-resourced.

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.510
They're gonna find ways

00:13:38.510 --> 00:13:40.130
to get around the sanctions

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:41.410
whether it's shell companies

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:42.680
or middleman or whatever.

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:44.400
It's just gonna be a
little less convenient

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:45.233
for them.

00:13:45.233 --> 00:13:46.066
So in the end,

00:13:46.066 --> 00:13:48.110
it's the Russian people
who are gonna suffer

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:49.570
the most here.

00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:52.220
Well, that is after the real victims

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:54.360
of this whole thing, the Ukrainian people

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:55.690
who have had country

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:57.583
senselessly stolen from them.

00:13:58.737 --> 00:14:02.237
(soft instrumental music)

